# This file is an independent, fan-made instance graph carrying simulation
# annotations for Magic: The Gathering cards: machine-readable behavior hooks
# and threat weights consumed by the Monte-Carlo matchup simulator
# (scripts/mtgsim). These annotations are house-authored simulation opinion,
# not card facts. The file is not produced by, endorsed by, or affiliated
